
{
  "title": "Insurance Application Health",
  "description": "PoC insurance-business-observability | env:local | ms-propostas -> Outbox -> Kafka -> ms-cadastro. Queries use received series; metrics are best effort, not a financial ledger. Owner scope: this PoC only. https://us5.datadoghq.com/logs?query=project%3Ainsurance-business-observability%20env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29 https://us5.datadoghq.com/apm/traces?query=env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": [
        "local"
      ],
      "defaults": [
        "local"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "available_values": [
        "ms-propostas",
        "ms-cadastro"
      ],
      "defaults": [
        "*"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Insurance Business Observability — saúde técnica**\n\nSomente séries recebidas. Heartbeat JVM não substitui probe HTTP. Hikari mede pool de conexões, não métricas internas do PostgreSQL. Não foi habilitado DBM, Synthetics ou integração adicional paga.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Requisições HTTP — todas as rotas",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "count:http.server.requests{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {service,uri}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
